  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>熔爐回收為所有含有金屬的原版物品添加了熔煉配方。你無法回收製作物品時所使用的全部材料，但累積起來的少量鐵和金也相當可觀。熔煉廢棄礦坑中的鐵軌，或偷取村莊裡的鐘。你甚至可能從此不用再挖礦了！由於每個物品回收的材料較少，因此不存在複製的風險。<br><br>以下是完整的熔煉配方列表。每個物品的熔煉時間為 200 刻，並提供 0.1 經驗值。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>鐵砧：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>鐘：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>鍋釜：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>（靈魂）燈籠：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>切石機：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>完整熔煉配方列表：</strong></span><br><em>觸發鐵軌 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>鐵砧 -> 鐵方塊</em><br><em>鐘 -> 金錠</em><br><em>高爐 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>桶 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>鍋釜 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>鎖鏈 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>弩 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>感測鐵軌 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>打火石 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>重質測重壓力板 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>漏斗 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>鐵柵欄 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>鐵門 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>（靈魂）燈籠 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>輕質測重壓力板 -> 金錠</em><br><em>礦車 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>（黏性）活塞 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>動力鐵軌 -> 金粒</em><br><em>鐵軌 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>剪刀 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>盾牌 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>鍛造台 -> 鐵錠</em><br><em>切石機 -> 鐵粒</em><br><em>絆線鉤 -> 鐵粒</em></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要該模組的下載仍位於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
